<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">As Fifa continues to face scrutiny from so=
me confederations and fans, Thierry Henry has encouraged players to use the=
ir voice as the political battle for control of international soccer unfold=
s. The former Arsenal and Barcelona forward turned pundit spoke with the Gu=
ardian on Tuesday alongside Kate Scott and Jamie Carragher as CBS and Param=
ount prepare for this season=E2=80=99s Champions League broadcasts.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CFor me, the players have more pow=
er than they think they have,=E2=80=9D Henry said when asked for his though=
ts on the situation. =E2=80=9CAnd if they want it to change, they can make =
it happen =E2=80=93 especially nowadays.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Fifa has been under public duress in the w=
ake of multiple scandals surrounding the 2026 World Cup, exacerbated furthe=
r after reports of Gianni Infantino=E2=80=99s effort to sell the World Cup=
=E2=80=99s commercial rights. The ensuing month has seen the Fifa president=
 face significant criticism, with <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.thegu=
ardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaN=
sDra0BxnPgFemBeq6i5JJRqFvJyLeRUhhrLSbczuXUlAQfVBG0AMBZG_zfLHC3kDMKCNwD-E3R7=
XXirH7KN_YZgMKFiD0ocAB_TvdOTVFrxDwiL_6irD5TbUoXgEmYmZlMcQeFn8YnMNl8ZRdugJK_=
uZhnnr8zqhhhGaX6tS7CD-qH2cVQhoadCQBJ_wlwf44iYrjZpzmY0iutvsp0ACbQn724KAzKjBg=
EDY3URmS7dwpF87Ei5ujyLlqgFcUmklnzzWOSaIEiIFdQzt3rWFNZ7ihvtkp9TIlUHo1w3HwPzE=
1VBoCqYDA/4tq/nsxF4otRTsOp1jPA8bEIjA/h13/h001.I_IHYTno_pkXrlCeD3hFoJxlDQeO5=
YFn6HGHxNKQi_I" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Uefa exploring potential legal op=
tions</a> against Infantino.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Scott, who anchors the CBS panel comprisin=
g Henry, Carragher and Micah Richards, spoke extensively about 2021=E2=80=
=99s attempted Super League project and the ensuing debacle in an Apple TV =
documentary. The Super League saga seemed to pit the business interests of =
the sport class against the game=E2=80=99s heart, represented by players, c=
oaches and fans. The latest situation involving Fifa has progressed in a si=
milar spirit.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CI think it=E2=80=99s going to be =
really interesting to see [what comes next],=E2=80=9D Scott said. =E2=80=9C=
I think probably a large portion of world football has come to a point wher=
e they would like to see a change in [the Fifa presidency], similarly to th=
e way we felt about [the Super League] =E2=80=A6 I think if you=E2=80=99re =
invested in the game and you love the game, it just kind of leaves a bad ta=
ste.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Infantino has been re-elected twice since =
2016, both times without a challenger. The next vote is slated for 18 March=
 2027, with no alternative having declared their candidacy.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CI have no idea which way that wil=
l go, because obviously one thing that Gianni Infantino has proven to be wi=
thin world football is a very smart power broker and has understood how to =
make allies, use those allies to his benefit,=E2=80=9D Scott said.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">For Henry, though, the voice of the player=
s can =E2=80=93 and should =E2=80=93 be a bigger part of the conversation.<=
/p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CPlayers have all the power if the=
y want to, and sometimes they don=E2=80=99t, I think, use it or realize act=
ually the power that they have,=E2=80=9D Henry said. =E2=80=9CYou guys in t=
he US know fully well: when the player wants to do something, the league li=
stens. You saw it with the NBA. You saw it with the NFL =E2=80=A6 At one po=
int, the players are always on the side: go entertain, take your money, lea=
ve.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CUs debating about it here, what=
=E2=80=99s going to change? We can all have a view whether it=E2=80=99s a g=
ood one or a bad one =E2=80=A6 But for me, the players have more power than=
 they think they have. And if they want it to change, they can make it happ=
en =E2=80=93 especially nowadays.=E2=80=9D</p>
